    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18244" root="زنر" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنِّيرٌ</span></b> , (T, TA,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنِّيرَةٌ</span></b> , as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُنَّارَةٌ</span></b> , (TA,)
sing. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنَانِيرُ</span>, (T, TA,) which signifies <i>Pebbles:</i>
(IAar:) or <i>small pebbles.</i> (A'Obeyd, Kr, ISd,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنِّيرٌ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُنَّارٌ</span></b>  (Kr,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنِّيرَةٌ</span></b>  and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُنَّارَةٌ</span></b> , (TA,) <i>Certain small flies</i> (Kr, K) <i>that
are in</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُشُوش</span> [i. e. <i>gardens,</i> or <i>privies</i>]. (Kr,
TA.)

